Cell["\<\
Reshaping the boosted phase space of LLPs for convenient calculation of the \
decay products acceptance\
\>", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.949414963985182*^9, 
  3.949414981641266*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"66928a26-2eca-db44-8f6c-\
